  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Mi Lan Guang tells Great Treasury Immortal that the move is called everybody’s vision, a human path killer move created by Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable. It uses the foundation of people’s united hearts and lets Central Continent’s mortals, Gu Masters, and Gu Immortals share their vision. If someone sees Jian Yi Sheng’s movement light or even a trace of his tracks, Mi Lan Guang can obtain that information through everybody’s vision and catch him.",
      "chapters": [
        1744
